"""layers.1.mlp.down_proj:1477 — a "build / make / create / burn" word detector.

What the component does: it fires on the word token itself when the word is a form of
"build" (strongest: "build", "Build", "builder", "rebuild"; a bit less "building", "built"),
"burn", "make" or "create". Its activation is large and positive on those tokens and about
zero everywhere else. Its output direction does not promote any particular next token, so
the program only says where it fires and roughly how strongly.

Levels are the mean activations measured on training text (build ~3.5, building/built ~2.4,
burn ~2, make/made ~0.8, create ~0.6). Context changes them only modestly (make varies by
about 0.2), so one value per word is kept.

