"""A spelling detector for code, coding, and encoding/decoding.

Intact code-family words give moderate positive pulses. Splitting the root
across tokens usually gives a larger pulse. The immediately attached endings
of these roots can also fire. Case, separators, and status-code phrases adjust
the strength. Other text is assigned zero; document boundaries reset the word.
