"""A vol-centered spelling detector, strongest across a token boundary.

Recognize short vol fragments and the volume/involve/evolve word families.
A v followed by ol in the next token gets a much stronger response, with
brief continuation into the next fragment. Include Cyrillic/Japanese
spellings and Chinese 音量 (sound volume). Short v-ic/v-us fragments and
middle-dot runs are negative. Reset state at document boundaries and use
a small negative document-start offset. Ignore most weak background variation.
